      "takeaway": "Brussels is demanding Spain do two contradictory things at once: safeguard migrant minors while deporting every irregular migrant from Ceuta.",
      "why_it_matters": "Spain faces pressure from Brussels to simultaneously manage the protection of vulnerable migrant children in Ceuta while returning all irregular migrants to Morocco, creating a direct conflict in government policy that will determine how the Spanish authorities handle the ongoing migration crisis in the enclave."
